<title>USA: US corn gluten meal prices steady, some sales.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten meal prices steady, some sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal prices were mostly unchanged, with Illinois and Iowa dealers reporting steady sales to domestic customers.</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  102.00    102.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -  101.00    101.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
